      "content": "im just busy with work and the clinic is like a 45 min drive away lol. i had a tetanus shot a few years ago i think? if i just flush it out really well with the peroxide and maybe put some neosporin on it, is that enough to keep it from getting nasty? i dont see why i need to drive all that way if it looks clean now.",
