      "content": "idk i just feel like im overreacting. it's not even that deep or anything, just a little poke. if i can't make it to the doctor today, what's the absolute best way to treat it at home so i don't end up needing one? like what should i be doing to make sure it doesn't get infected? give me a step by step for home care.",
